Description: Argon ONE V5 OLED Experimental Next-Gen Suite & Visual Card Studio
 Next-generation C daemon, CLI, Desktop Control Center, and Visual Card Builder
 for the Argon ONE V5 (Raspberry Pi 5) SSD1306 128x64 I2C OLED display.
 Features pixel-perfect 1-bit Terminus Bold bitmap typography, custom card
 design tools, hardware sensor discovery, and live shared-memory OLED mirroring.
